      "parameters": {
        "content": "# EnergyGrid Drive destination setup (manual, inactive)\n\n- Manual Trigger only. Never called by Claude, the core or any other workflow.\n- Resolves My Drive / Automation / _MandarinGallery / Utilities / EnergyGrid one level at a time; never creates chain levels.\n- Finds or creates exactly once the EB Bill and Tenant Bill child folders, then searches again. Never deletes anything.\n- Any missing, ambiguous or incomplete result stops with a fixed EG_DRIVE_* reference.\n- The operator copies the resulting folder IDs into the private v3 config, then runs `drive-bind --apply`.\n",
